Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.85,0:02:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll pay you back, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.31,0:02:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten thousand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.22,0:02:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have that much money on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.43,0:02:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, go withdraw it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.79,0:02:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.17,0:02:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.35,0:02:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.73,0:02:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not giving you guys any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.63,0:02:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll do this the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.25,0:02:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.55,0:02:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.67,0:03:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.11,0:03:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.21,0:03:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor Asada.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.31,0:03:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know my big brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.01,0:03:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he's got a buttload\Nof these model guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.89,0:03:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be cool if\NI brought some to class?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.59,0:03:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you like guns, especially pistols.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.41,0:03:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, someone's gonna hurl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.07,0:03:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember when you blew\Nchunks in class and fainted?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.69,0:03:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, God, that stank like ass for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is give us your\Nmoney and we'll let you go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.77,0:03:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you, Anna?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.89,0:03:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you look like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.77,0:03:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The girl's getting mugged in the alley!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.81,0:03:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.41,0:03:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.01,0:04:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asura, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.83,0:04:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm fine, Shinkawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.91,0:04:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.07,0:04:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I heard what happened the other\Nday you went on quite the rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.83,0:04:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah but for a strategy\Nit was a fail I mean we
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.21,0:04:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,started the op with six\Nand lost four by the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of it if that's the outcome of\Nan ambush we set up it's not
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.57,0:04:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much of a win you know you\Nwere pretty Rad though you know
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.13,0:04:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that behemoth guy with the\Nminigun he was kind of a legend in
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.23,0:04:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the game because he never bought\Nit in a squad fight before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.89,0:04:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea he was that good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.35,0:04:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never really saw his\Nrankings in B .O .B.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.65,0:04:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His days were numbered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.09,0:04:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, no matter how\Npowerful a minigun is?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.43,0:04:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Carrying 500 rounds of ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.95,0:05:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pushes you over the weight\Nlimit so you can't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.77,0:05:03.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since B .O .B.'s a\Nsolo encounter battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.17,0:05:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he was easy pickings\Nfor a sniper like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.67,0:05:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, with that gun, he's pretty much\Ninvincible as long as he's with a good squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The minigun should be banned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.93,0:05:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we're talking about banning weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.13,0:05:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't forget, some people\Nthink my Hecate's a cheat, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.65,0:05:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As its owner, I have to admit, using\Nit does have its own special problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.97,0:05:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wish I had problems like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.47,0:05:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what are your plans\Nfor the next B .O .B.?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.19,0:05:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm definitely entering.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.35,0:05:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did my homework and have most of the info\Nof the top 20 players from the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.57,0:05:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I've got my Hecate now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.83,0:05:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With her in my hands,\NI'm sure I can kill...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.23,0:05:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, crack the higher ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.09,0:05:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can take out all my enemies and\Nprove I'm the strongest, I'll be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.97,0:05:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.75,0:05:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asada, you're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.95,0:06:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having that awesome gun is one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.23,0:06:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you were also smart enough to put your
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.21,0:06:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,points on strength stats\Nso you could use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.83,0:06:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who got you into GGO.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.57,0:06:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I've been totally left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.37,0:06:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is so not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.95,0:06:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the last qualifier, you made it all\Nthe way to the semi-finals, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.35,0:06:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.29,0:06:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An AGI build only gets you so far in GGO.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.47,0:06:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A good gun helps too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.21,0:06:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spent points on the wrong stat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.51,0:06:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get so down about that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.65,0:06:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sign up for B .O .B.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.56,0:06:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and see what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.65,0:06:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, no point. I just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.09,0:06:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.47,0:06:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how are your studies coming along?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.01,0:06:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still want to be a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.71,0:06:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is the family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised my dad I'd go to med\Nschool, so it's a done deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.79,0:06:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stuck with it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.05,0:06:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what about cram school and the GED?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.21,0:06:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are those going okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.75,0:06:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.23,0:06:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.59,0:06:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm maintaining the same rank\NI had when I was at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Staying sharp, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.11,0:07:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Locked and loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.59,0:07:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.53,0:07:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reason I asked is because\Nyou're always online when I log on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.43,0:07:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I was a little worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.05,0:07:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're online that\Nmuch, when do you study?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.73,0:07:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do most of my studying during the\Nday, and I take lots of breaks too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.31,0:07:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be making tons of cash if\Nyou're diving all the time like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.55,0:07:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not making that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.99,0:07:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Solo hunting's impossible\Nfor AGI Builds these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.37,0:07:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, you're doing great if you're\Nearning enough for the connection fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.17,0:07:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, it's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.95,0:07:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I have to get going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.43,0:07:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.51,0:07:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you still making\Ndinner for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.57,0:07:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love to try more of\Nyour cooking someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.63,0:07:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.54,0:07:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just, I think I need\Nto get better at it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.19,0:07:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.59,0:07:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And thanks, I mean thank\Nyou, for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.17,0:08:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could always\Nbe there to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, if you want, I can\Nwalk you home every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.73,0:08:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.79,0:08:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.43,0:08:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.75,0:08:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only way I'll get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.45,0:08:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.33,0:09:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.21,0:09:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't remember what dad looked like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.79,0:09:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember hearing he died\Nin a car accident, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.69,0:09:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometime before I turned two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.39,0:10:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After the accident, my\Nmom and I left Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.57,0:10:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We went to go live with her parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.97,0:10:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was peaceful there for both of us.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.48,0:10:12.57,Android,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\fax-0.01\c&H6C706C&\pos(270,514.5)\fscx34\fscy38}Mail
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.69,0:10:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, one day, that\Npeace was shattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.69,0:10:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put the money in the bag, goddammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.73,0:10:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't hit the alarm, or else...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.51,0:10:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.42,0:10:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't just stand there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.09,0:10:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start filling it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.55,0:10:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.89,0:10:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.65,0:11:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told him not to!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.77,0:11:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.07,0:11:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.69,0:11:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fill it up or you get it, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.55,0:11:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me the money now or\NI'm gonna kill her next!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.61,0:11:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll do it!
