Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.65,0:11:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,YOU LITTLE GIVE IT STUCK\NYOU BRATS! LET'S GO!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.99,0:11:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, my gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.65,0:12:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.81,0:12:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.65,0:12:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.55,0:13:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.63,0:13:51.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.05,0:13:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody. Anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.73,0:13:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.73,0:14:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.75,0:14:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding, you're quitting ALO?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.77,0:14:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'll just be gone\Nfor a couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.57,0:14:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll convert back after that. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.17,0:14:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, it's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.57,0:14:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's this other virtual\NMMO that I need to check out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.63,0:14:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need to, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.21,0:14:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've done this before\Nand just used new accounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.73,0:14:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not for this one, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.43,0:14:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, if you convert,\Nyour items will be reset.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.61,0:14:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you want to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.57,0:14:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's like a favor for\Nthat guy from the government.
