Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.45,0:14:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess if Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.61,0:14:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kikuoka is asking you\Nto, you can't say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.51,0:14:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what it is about that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.91,0:14:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's a part of me that\Nstill has a hard time trusting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.99,0:15:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm not too sure\NI can trust him either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.19,0:15:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just get back as soon as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.71,0:15:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our home, and it's\Nnot the same without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.07,0:15:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll be back\Nin ALO before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.75,0:15:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just dive into Gun Gale\Nonline for a couple days,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.81,0:15:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see what's going on, and that's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.87,0:15:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm 99 % sure the Death\NGun story's a hoax.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.69,0:15:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably someone trolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.39,0:15:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't kill someone in the real\Nworld from the virtual anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.67,0:15:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.39,0:15:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is real power, real strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.97,0:15:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let your fear carve one\Nname into your brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.41,0:15:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name I share with\Nthis weapon, Death Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.65,0:16:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's still that 1\N% chance it could be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.85,0:16:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.87,0:16:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, anyone here? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.67,0:16:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Kirigaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.75,0:16:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.66,0:16:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aki, it's nice to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.93,0:16:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy — Whoa, you finally\Ngot some meat on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.85,0:16:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could use some filling out, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.83,0:16:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure you're eating right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.25,0:16:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm eating, I'm eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.25,0:16:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.67,0:16:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friend in the suit and\Nglasses told me about your mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.09,0:16:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said something about\Nyou going into a virtual
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.73,0:16:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,network and doing some\Nreconnaissance or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.59,0:16:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he'd ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.53,0:16:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you've only been back for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.61,0:16:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, he found out I was the one\Nwho was in charge of your rehab.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.49,0:16:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he asked me to keep an eye\Non your monitors while you dive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.63,0:16:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They took me off my normal\Nshift and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.97,0:17:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The head nurse wasn't happy,\Nbut what can she do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.99,0:17:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the government wants\Nsomething, they're gonna get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.95,0:17:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess you and me are\Nback together again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.65,0:17:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks for being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.95,0:17:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's just us today,\Nno Ki-Kuoka? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.51,0:17:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He asked me to give you a message, though.
