Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.35,0:17:48.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, if it's okay, I'd like to\Nconnect to the network now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.47,0:17:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.81,0:17:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all set up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.05,0:18:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, hot stuff. Strip! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.25,0:18:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the electrodes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.03,0:18:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.67,0:18:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen all your goodies before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.25,0:18:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, can I just take off my shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.97,0:18:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.45,0:18:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.36,0:18:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.75,0:18:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.47,0:18:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wish me luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.85,0:18:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see this taking me\Nmore than four or five hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.33,0:18:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.57,0:18:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't you worry about\Nyour body while you're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.33,0:18:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep a close eye on it. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.21,0:18:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel better already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.59,0:18:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Link, start!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.97,0:18:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.93,0:19:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm used to the school now, and\NI've made some friends, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.81,0:19:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.95,0:19:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've only had a couple\Npanic attacks, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.09,0:19:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Grandpa, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.37,0:19:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you catch any colds, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.91,0:19:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll come home for winter break.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.85,0:19:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.85,0:19:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since that day, whenever\NI see a gun, I freak out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.23,0:19:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I see a picture of one, or see one\Non TV, I'm guaranteed a panic attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.45,0:19:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came to Tokyo for high school,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.71,0:19:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thinking if I got far enough\Naway from home, it'd help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.93,0:19:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.09,0:19:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One day,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.41,0:19:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shinkawa told me about Gun Gale Online,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.75,0:19:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I thought it could work\Nas a kind of therapy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.55,0:19:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in a way, it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.17,0:19:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As Sinon, when I'm holding a gun or\Nwhen someone's drawing down on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.55,0:20:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.33,0:20:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figure the stronger Sinon gets, the\Nstronger I'll get in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.59,0:20:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I keep fighting with my Akati too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.89,0:20:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hoping it'll help me kick this phobia?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.23,0:20:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Winning the next bullet\Nof bullets will cure me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.53,0:20:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.45,0:20:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.57,0:20:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Link start
